    <string name="settings_bypass">Local sites skip the tunnel</string>
    <string name="settings_bypass_desc">Names ending in .ru, .рф, .su, .by or .kz are resolved and reached on the ordinary network. Banking apps and local sites start working again — and this network can see which of them you use. Off unless you turn it on.</string>
